# Root build context for the backend image (docker-compose backend: context: .).
# Needed: the backend module + the block sources (infra/plugins/* — node MCP servers, baked into
# /srv/plugins in the plugins stage) + infra/scripts (the lint tools live OUTSIDE backend — make
# lint reaches ../infra/scripts). Everything else (app/, e2e/, docs/, .git, node_modules, other
# modules) bloats the context — exclude it all, then re-include just what the build needs.
*
!backend
# infra/scripts holds the lint tooling (shell checks + the check-no-nil-container Go
# module); infra/updater holds the updater sidecar's script (its image COPYs it in). Nested
# re-include: descend into infra, drop the rest, keep just those two.
!infra
infra/*
!infra/scripts
!infra/updater
# infra/plugins holds the node MCP block sources (ask-visitor / booker / retrieval / summarize /
# mail-sender / caldav / fetch): the plugins stage npm-installs each into /srv/plugins. Their
# node_modules is excluded by the global rule below (installed in the image, not carried in).
# infra/dsh-acceptance (the koishi/everything/fsmcp demos) stays excluded — dev-only test fixtures.
!infra/plugins
# ...but never the dsh-testkit run evidence: local `make dsh-plugin-test` output (runs/evidence),
# not product code, and it carries secret-shaped strings the image-secrets scan rejects. It must
# never bake into /srv/plugins in the image.
infra/plugins/**/.dsh-testkit

# im-bridge also uses the root context (it needs @standmeet/sdk-core, which lives under sdk/ —
# outside its own directory). Pull in only the source and pnpm's three manifests; node_modules
# is excluded by the rule below, so the backend context grows by just a few hundred KB of source.
!im-bridge
!sdk
sdk/*
!sdk/packages
sdk/packages/*
!sdk/packages/core
# mcp-client: the backend bakes its packed tarball (npm pack) into the image and serves it at
# GET /api/mcp-package for update_self (docs/design/mcp-self-update.md).
!sdk/packages/mcp-client
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!package.json

# 依赖目录一律不进 context：镜像里自己装，带进去只会又大又不一致。
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Re-exclude noise inside the included trees (mirrors the old backend/.dockerignore).
# .git excluded → lint's gitleaks scans the tree, not history; history out of image.
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
**/bin/
# …but the mcp-client's bin/ (its CLI entrypoint) must ride along — npm pack ships it.
!sdk/packages/mcp-client/bin
**/out/
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
